# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored -- never commit
# the real values here.
#
# Same Supabase project apps/api's root .env points DATABASE_URL at (ask in
# the team channel, or Project Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard).
# Only the anon key belongs here -- it's safe to expose client-side by
# design (Postgres RLS gates what it can actually do). Never put the
# service-role key in apps/web; that one stays in apps/api's .env only.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
